				<title>Board Decks to Confetti, Without the Jam: Fellowes 99Ci</title>
				<link>http://localhost:3001/reviews/fellowes-99ci/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:3001/reviews/fellowes-99ci/</guid>
				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;P-4 micro-cut particles are effectively impossible to reassemble.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;100% jam-proof feed handles mixed stacks without stopping.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Long runtime before the motor needs to cool.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Bin large enough for a real purge, not just a few sheets.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Fellowes&amp;#43;Powershred&amp;#43;99Ci&amp;#43;micro&amp;#43;cut&amp;#43;shredder&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Fellowes Powershred 99Ci Micro-Cut Shredder&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;strip-cut-isnt-shredding&#34;&gt;Strip-cut isn&amp;rsquo;t shredding&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A strip-cut shredder produces ribbons a determined person can tape back together. For anything genuinely confidential — deal documents, board materials, HR files — you want micro-cut, which turns a page into hundreds of confetti particles. If your printer produces anything sensitive, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Fellowes&amp;#43;Powershred&amp;#43;99Ci&amp;#43;micro&amp;#43;cut&amp;#43;shredder&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Fellowes Powershred 99Ci Micro-Cut Shredder&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;check the Amazon price&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2.5&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
